{"id":"e80bb762ee6310f9","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-generic-generalized-low.md","title":"n泛型的广义低性","display":"thm-generic-generalized-low — n泛型的广义低性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-generic-generalized-low","aliases":["43-thm-generic-generalized-low"],"display":"thm-generic-generalized-low — n泛型的广义低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 11.15.4 (Jockusch [133])","source_printed_pages":"287","source_pdf_pages":"307","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-15-round2"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-generic-generalized-low"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-generic-generalized-low</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-generic-generalized-low — n泛型的广义低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.15.4 (Jockusch [133])"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"287"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"307"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-15-round2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in2^\\omega\">\\(G\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{NGeneric}\\)</span>、跳跃、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。序列与其特征集合按本目录固定对应解释。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,n)\\Rightarrow G^{(n)}\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing^{(n)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{NGeneric}(G,n)\\Rightarrow G^{(n)}\\equiv_TG\\oplus\\varnothing^{(n)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留G⊕∅<sup>(n)，不能误写为G</sup>(n)≡∅<sup>(n)，后者需要G≤∅</sup>(n)等额外条件。来源用泛型决定Σ_n算术断言取得上界，反向由跳跃单调性与G≤G^(n)成立。</p>\n<p>来源：所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.15.4 (Jockusch [133])，印刷页287，PDF页307。核对了来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$、跳跃、$\\oplus$、$\\equiv_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-genericity]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。序列与其特征集合按本目录固定对应解释。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G\\in2^\\omega$，$n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{NGeneric}$、跳跃、$\\oplus$、$\\equiv_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-genericity]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。序列与其特征集合按本目录固定对应解释。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"